    "notes": [
      "Sidebar counts align at the right edge and give way to a small add toolbar on hover. Running/History sits at the top right of Operations.",
      "Sidebar section headers reveal a \"+\" on hover or keyboard focus to open their add flow. Insert provides the same shortcut.",
      "Operations opens only when requested and shows a wider summary when space allows. Mode and filter choices use themed segmented toggles with keyboard navigation.",
      "Worktree deletion is disabled for protected worktrees, with a reason available in the menu.",
      "Clicking a staged or unstaged file keeps it in place while selection and focus updates arrive.",
      "Diff search now highlights results, shows the active hit, and navigates with previous/next buttons, Enter/Shift+Enter, or F3/Shift+F3. Escape clears the search."
